@startuml
title Strategy Pattern Workflow

participant "RagNode" as RagNode
participant "策略列表" as Strategies
participant "FusionStrategy" as Fusion
participant "检索系统" as Retrieval
participant "LLM" as LLM

RagNode -> Strategies : applyStrategies(query)
Strategies -> Retrieval : 执行各个策略的检索
Retrieval --> Strategies : 返回检索结果
Strategies -> Fusion : 融合多个策略结果
Fusion --> Strategies : 返回融合结果
Strategies -> LLM : 结合检索结果生成回答
LLM --> Strategies : 返回生成结果
Strategies --> RagNode : 返回最终结果

@enduml
